# P114 on Android: the system Back key pops the NavigationStack while it has anything pushed.
# Pushes go through the drawn controls (taplabel); every pop is `key back` (KEYCODE_BACK, delivered to the activity and its OnBackPressedDispatcher).
# The file ends with a push, so the app is still in front for the final capture. Back at the root -- which must finish or background the activity as before -- and the back gesture are checked from outside by testapp/test_support/p114_back_android.zsh.
# Pass: the replay reports replayed; the log shows depths 1 2 3 2 1 0 1 in that order; the final capture shows the Fruits screen under a "‹ Home" back control.
# P114 在 Android 上：堆疊推入了內容時，系統返回鍵彈出 NavigationStack。推入用畫出的控制項(taplabel),每次彈出都是 `key back`。檔案以一次推入結束，讓最後擷圖時 app 仍在前景；根層的返回(必須如同以往結束或把 activity 送到背景)與返回手勢由 testapp/test_support/p114_back_android.zsh 從外部檢查。通過條件見上方英文說明。
sleep,,,,,,1500000,let P114 settle,android
taplabel,,,,,Open Fruits,,push Fruits (depth 1),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Open Untitled,,push Untitled (depth 2),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Open Leaf,,push Leaf (depth 3),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
key,,,,,back,,Back pops Leaf (depth 2),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
key,,,,,back,,Back pops Untitled (depth 1),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
key,,,,,back,,Back pops Fruits (depth 0),android
sleep,,,,,,1200000,,android
taplabel,,,,,Open Fruits,,push Fruits again (depth 1) -- the final capture shows ‹ Home,android
sleep,,,,,,1500000,,android
